        "id": 10237,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-28T14:03:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If I was going for the most thematic battles possible, which sectors should I choose? In the base game for SotM for example, Voss goes to Megaopolis, Dawn to Insula Primis, Baron Blade to Atlantis, and Omnitron to Mars. Is there a way we can do that with the Opposition forces in GSF?</p><p>Neo-Elves vs the Syndicate = I assume the Trade Out-post would be one, but how about the others? Galverun maybe?</p><p>Orcs vs Technovores = Not a clue where to start. Shipyards perhaps? The Wastes?</p><p>War Specters vs Nyotan = Oothagos Expanse I'd imagine would be one. The Eye and Tears as the others?</p><p>Dwarves vs Singularity = The Forge and Proto-Star fit the Dwarven theme, but maybe there are better choices?</p><p>Humans vs UFGD = The Belt would be my first choice, but others could inclue Shipyards and Trade Outpost?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:13.701Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
