      {
        "id": 100452,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-28T14:57:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Awesome! You did a great job - if you haven't already, you might want to check out the lore info posted at www.galacticstrikeforce.com since it contains a few more clues.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For UFGD, you definitely (thematically) want to include Proto-Star Y'Dera, since that is the site of the UFGD headquarters. The Shipyards are also a good choice.</p><p>For the Technovores, you definitely want to include the Kolvarian Wastes, since they are currently the playable secter closest to the&nbsp;<span><span>Chelicerian Abyss and the origin of the Infestation.</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:28:45.667Z",
