        "user_title": "Chief Justice",
        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Awesome! You did a great job - if you haven't already, you might want to check out the lore info posted at www.galacticstrikeforce.com since it contains a few more clues.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For UFGD, you definitely (thematically) want to include Proto-Star Y'Dera, since that is the site of the UFGD headquarters. The Shipyards are also a good choice.</p><p>For the Technovores, you definitely want to include the Kolvarian Wastes, since they are currently the playable secter closest to the&nbsp;<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-25ca1bb3-a8d4-ae6d-d59c-125c13b46b5c\"><span>Chelicerian Abyss and the origin of the Infestation.</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
